# Lychee ignore patterns - regex patterns for URLs to skip during link checking

# npmjs.com returns 403 to link checkers because of bot protection.
https://www\.npmjs\.com

# DocFX generates csharp/docs/api/*.yml into the build output; the files are
# deliberately not committed, so the relative link from csharp/docs/index.md
# cannot be resolved from a source checkout.
csharp/docs/api/

# Sub-sites of the unified GitHub Pages site, published by
# .github/workflows/docs.yml on merge to main. A pull request that documents
# them would otherwise fail on URLs it is about to create.
https://link-foundation\.github\.io/link-cli/(csharp|rust|docs)/
